### 5. patch-agent-canvas-pwa.ps1

#### 5.1 Multiple Backup Files - Filesystem Clutter
**Severity:** Low  
**Location:** `patch-agent-canvas-pwa.ps1`, Lines 25-30

**Failure Mechanism:**
```powershell
# Line 25-28: Creates multiple backup files with different suffixes
$IndexOrig = Join-Path $BuildDir "index.html.orig-pwa"
```
Over time, multiple `.orig-*` files will accumulate.

**Refactored Code:**
```powershell
# Use single canonical backup file
$IndexBackup = Join-Path $BuildDir "index.html.backup"
if (-not (Test-Path $IndexBackup)) {
    Copy-Item $IndexHtml $IndexBackup -Force
    Write-Host "[2/4] Created pristine PWA backup: $IndexBackup" -ForegroundColor Gray
}
```

#### 5.2 Service Worker Not Validated Before Registration
**Severity:** Medium  
**Location:** `patch-agent-canvas-pwa.ps1`, Lines 45-50

**Failure Mechanism:**
```powershell
# Line 45: Injects SW registration without validating sw.js exists
$swSnippet = '<script>if("serviceWorker" in navigator){window.addEventListener("load",function(){navigator.serviceWorker.register("/sw.js").catch(function(e){console.warn("SW register failed:",e);});});});</script>'
```
If sw.js is missing or invalid, the browser will log errors.

**Refactored Code:**
```powershell
# Validate sw.js exists before injecting registration
$swPath = Join-Path $BuildDir "sw.js"
if (Test-Path $swPath) {
    # Validate SW syntax
    $swContent = [System.IO.File]::ReadAllText($swPath, [System.Text.Encoding]::UTF8)
    if ($swContent -match 'self\.addEventListener\(') {
        $swSnippet = '<script>if("serviceWorker" in navigator){window.addEventListener("load",function(){navigator.serviceWorker.register("/sw.js").catch(function(e){console.warn("SW register failed:",e);});});});</script>'
    } else {
        Write-Warning "sw.js appears to be invalid, skipping service worker registration"
        $swSnippet = ''
    }
} else {
    Write-Warning "sw.js not found, skipping service worker registration"
    $swSnippet = ''
}
```

